            "type": "text",
            "text": "{\"label\":\"three-outcomes-v1\",\"action\":\"get_settings\",\"result\":[{\"status\":\"success\",\"message\":\"Settings retrieved\",\"data\":{\"type\":\"all_raw_settings\",\"total_matches\":4,\"matches\":[{\"key\":\"domId\",\"value\":\"\"},{\"key\":\"visibility\",\"value\":false},{\"key\":\"code\",\"value\":\"<!-- /services - THE LEAK (services-side reframe) - v1.1 ICONS\\n     4 diagnosis cards: overlapping SaaS, attribution blindness, ASO neglect, channel mis-spend.\\n     Each card carries a PMC inline icon (i-cast / i-radar / i-pin / i-ads) that animates on\\n     scroll-in and replays on hover. SVG defs (gradients + bloom) are injected once via body.html.\\n     HTML ONLY. No <style>, no <script>. -->\\n<div class=\\\"pmc-leak-grid\\\" role=\\\"list\\\">\\n\\n  <article class=\\\"pmc-leak-card\\\" role=\\\"listitem\\\">\\n    <svg class=\\\"pmc-ico i-cast\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 64 64\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">\\n      <line class=\\\"s2\\\" x1=\\\"32\\\" y1=\\\"32\\\" x2=\\\"18\\\" y2=\\\"18\\\"/>\\n      <line class=\\\"s2\\\" x1=\\\"32\\\" y1=\\\"32\\\" x2=\\\"46\\\" y2=\\\"18\\\"/>\\n      <line class=\\\"s2\\\" x1=\\\"32\\\" y1=\\\"32\\\" x2=\\\"18\\\" y2=\\\"46\\\"/>\\n      <line class=\\\"s2\\\" x1=\\\"32\\\" y1=\\\"32\\\" x2=\\\"46\\\" y2=\\\"46\\\"/>\\n      <circle class=\\\"wave v1 transient\\\" cx=\\\"32\\\" cy=\\\"32\\\" r=\\\"11\\\" stroke=\\\"url(#gLeaf)\\\" stroke-width=\\\"1.6\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\"/>\\n      <circle class=\\\"wave v2 transient\\\" cx=\\\"32\\\" cy=\\\"32\\\" r=\\\"16\\\" stroke=\\\"url(#gLeaf)\\\" stroke-width=\\\"1.6\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\"/>\\n      <circle class=\\\"wave v3 transient\\\" cx=\\\"32\\\" cy=\\\"32\\\" r=\\\"21\\\" stroke=\\\"url(#gGold)\\\" stroke-width=\\\"1.6\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\"/>\\n      <circle class=\\\"ep e1\\\" cx=\\\"18\\\" cy=\\\"18\\\" r=\\\"3.4\\\" fill=\\\"#071312\\\" stroke=\\\"url(#gLeaf)\\\" stroke-width=\\\"1.6\\\"/>\\n      <circle class=\\\"ep e2\\\" cx=\\\"46\\\" cy=\\\"18\\\" r=\\\"3.4\\\" fill=\\\"#071312\\\" stroke=\\\"url(#gLeaf)\\\" stroke-width=\\\"1.6\\\"/>\\n      <circle class=\\\"ep e3\\\" cx=\\\"18\\\" cy=\\\"46\\\" r=\\\"3.4\\\" fill=\\\"#071312\\\" stroke=\\\"url(#gLeaf)\\\" stroke-width=\\\"1.6\\\"/>\\n      <circle class=\\\"ep e4\\\" cx=\\\"46\\\" cy=\\\"46\\\" r=\\\"3.4\\\" fill=\\\"#071312\\\" stroke=\\\"url(#gLeaf)\\\" stroke-width=\\\"1.6\\\"/>\\n      <circle class=\\\"core fg bloomg\\\" cx=\\\"32\\\" cy=\\\"32\\\" r=\\\"4.3\\\"/>\\n    </svg>\\n    <span class=\\\"pmc-leak-label\\\">LEAK 01</span>\\n    <h3 class=\\\"pmc-leak-title\\\">Overlapping software</h3>\\n    <p class=\\\"pmc-leak-body\\\">You are paying three tools to do one job. Your last audit was your accountant noticing the renewals, not your team noticing the waste.</p>\\n  </article>\\n\\n  <article class=\\\"pmc-leak-card\\\" role=\\\"listitem\\\">\\n    <svg class=\\\"pmc-ico i-radar\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 64 64\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">\\n      <circle class=\\\"field\\\" cx=\\\"32\\\" cy=\\\"32\\\" r=\\\"22.5\\\" stroke-dasharray=\\\"1.5 6\\\"/>\\n      <circle class=\\\"s\\\" cx=\\\"32\\\" cy=\\\"32\\\" r=\\\"17\\\"/>\\n      <circle class=\\\"s2\\\" cx=\\\"32\\\" cy=\\\"32\\\" r=\\\"10.5\\\"/>\\n      <circle class=\\\"s2\\\" cx=\\\"32\\\" cy=\\\"32\\\" r=\\\"4\\\"/>\\n      <g class=\\\"sweep\\\">\\n        <path d=\\\"M32 32 L32 15 A17 17 0 0 1 46 23 Z\\\" fill=\\\"url(#gGold)\\\" opacity=\\\"0.18\\\"/>\\n        <line class=\\\"sg\\\" x1=\\\"32\\\" y1=\\\"32\\\" x2=\\\"32\\\" y2=\\\"15\\\" stroke-width=\\\"1.5\\\"/>\\n      </g>\\n      <circle class=\\\"ring transient sg\\\" cx=\\\"43\\\" cy=\\\"24\\\" r=\\\"5\\\" stroke-width=\\\"1.4\\\"/>\\n      <circle class=\\\"blip fg bloomg\\\" cx=\\\"43\\\" cy=\\\"24\\\" r=\\\"2.7\\\"/>\\n      <g class=\\\"lock\\\">\\n        <path class=\\\"sg\\\" d=\\\"M43 18 L43 21\\\" stroke-width=\\\"1.4\\\"/>\\n        <path class=\\\"sg\\\" d=\\\"M43 27 L43 30\\\" stroke-width=\\\"1.4\\\"/>\\n        <path class=\\\"sg\\\" d=\\\"M37 24 L40 24\\\" stroke-width=\\\"1.4\\\"/>\\n        <path class=\\\"sg\\\" d=\\\"M46 24 L49 24\\\" stroke-width=\\\"1.4\\\"/>\\n      </g>\\n    </svg>\\n    <span class=\\\"pmc-leak-label\\\">LEAK 02</span>\\n    <h3 class=\\\"pmc-leak-title\\\">Attribution blindness</h3>\\n    <p class=\\\"pmc-leak-body\\\">You can tell me revenue is up. You cannot tell me which channel earned it. So you keep funding what you always funded.</p>\\n  </article>\\n\\n  <article class=\\\"pmc-leak-card\\\" role=\\\"listitem\\\">\\n    <svg class=\\\"pmc-ico i-pin\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 64 64\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">\\n      <path class=\\\"field\\\" d=\\\"M10 20 L26 14 L40 20 L54 14 M22 12 L22 50 M40 18 L40 52\\\"/>\\n      <path class=\\\"route\\\" d=\\\"M14 48 Q24 42 32 44 Q42 46 44 38\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"url(#gGold)\\\" stroke-width=\\\"1.6\\\" stroke-dasharray=\\\"3 3.4\\\" opacity=\\\".6\\\" stroke-dashoffset=\\\"44\\\"/>\\n      <ellipse class=\\\"ripple transient\\\" cx=\\\"32\\\" cy=\\\"51\\\" rx=\\\"11\\\" ry=\\\"3.4\\\" stroke=\\\"url(#gGold)\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\"/>\\n      <ellipse class=\\\"ripple r2 transient\\\" cx=\\\"32\\\" cy=\\\"51\\\" rx=\\\"11\\\" ry=\\\"3.4\\\" stroke=\\\"url(#gGold)\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\"/>\\n      <g class=\\\"pin\\\">\\n        <path class=\\\"s\\\" d=\\\"M32 13 C24 13 18 19 18 27 C18 37 32 49 32 49 C32 49 46 37 46 27 C46 19 40 13 32 13 Z\\\" style=\\\"stroke-width:2\\\"/>\\n        <path class=\\\"hl\\\" d=\\\"M24 18 A10 10 0 0 1 32 15.5\\\"/>\\n        <circle class=\\\"fg bloomg\\\" cx=\\\"32\\\" cy=\\\"27\\\" r=\\\"4\\\"/>\\n      </g>\\n    </svg>\\n    <span class=\\\"pmc-leak-label\\\">LEAK 03</span>\\n    <h3 class=\\\"pmc-leak-title\\\">ASO neglect</h3>\\n    <p class=\\\"pmc-leak-body\\\">Your app is downloaded by people who already knew about you. The App Store is a search engine you do not show up in.</p>\\n  </article>\\n\\n  <article class=\\\"pmc-leak-card\\\" role=\\\"listitem\\\">\\n    <svg class=\\\"pmc-ico i-ads\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 64 64\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">\\n      <line class=\\\"field\\\" x1=\\\"17\\\" y1=\\\"22\\\" x2=\\\"49\\\" y2=\\\"22\\\"/>\\n      <line class=\\\"field\\\" x1=\\\"17\\\" y1=\\\"31\\\" x2=\\\"49\\\" y2=\\\"31\\\"/>\\n      <line class=\\\"field\\\" x1=\\\"17\\\" y1=\\\"40\\\" x2=\\\"49\\\" y2=\\\"40\\\"/>\\n      <line class=\\\"s2\\\" x1=\\\"16\\\" y1=\\\"16\\\" x2=\\\"16\\\" y2=\\\"47\\\"/>\\n      <line class=\\\"s2\\\" x1=\\\"16\\\" y1=\\\"47\\\" x2=\\\"49\\\" y2=\\\"47\\\"/>\\n      <rect class=\\\"bar r1 fl\\\" x=\\\"20\\\" y=\\\"35\\\" width=\\\"5.4\\\" height=\\\"12\\\" rx=\\\"1.6\\\"/>\\n      <rect class=\\\"bar r2 fl\\\" x=\\\"28.5\\\" y=\\\"30\\\" width=\\\"5.4\\\" height=\\\"17\\\" rx=\\\"1.6\\\"/>\\n      <rect class=\\\"bar r3 fl\\\" x=\\\"37\\\" y=\\\"25\\\" width=\\\"5.4\\\" height=\\\"22\\\" rx=\\\"1.6\\\"/>\\n      <rect class=\\\"bar r4 fg\\\" x=\\\"45.5\\\" y=\\\"18\\\" width=\\\"5.4\\\" height=\\\"29\\\" rx=\\\"1.6\\\"/>\\n      <polyline class=\\\"trend sg\\\" points=\\\"20,33 51,10\\\" stroke-dasharray=\\\"40\\\"/>\\n      <g class=\\\"head\\\"><path class=\\\"sg\\\" d=\\\"M45 11.3 L51 10 L48 15.4\\\" stroke-width=\\\"1.6\\\"/></g>\\n      <circle class=\\\"burst transient fg bloomg\\\" cx=\\\"51\\\" cy=\\\"10\\\" r=\\\"2.4\\\"/>\\n    </svg>\\n    <span class=\\\"pmc-leak-label\\\">LEAK 04</span>\\n    <h3 class=\\\"pmc-leak-title\\\">Channel mis-spend</h3>\\n    <p class=\\\"pmc-leak-body\\\">You spend the most where the conversion is the slowest. The dashboards do not tell you because they were not built to.</p>\\n  </article>\\n\\n</div>\"},{\"key\":\"attributes\",\"value\":[{\"name\":\"data-pmc-preserved-source\",\"value\":\"services-three-outcomes-v1-before-premium-replacement\"},{\"name\":\"hidden\",\"value\":\"hidden\"},{\"name\":\"aria-hidden\",\"value\":\"true\"}]}]}}]}"
