            "type": "text",
            "text": "{\"label\":\"legacy-capabilities\",\"action\":\"get_settings\",\"result\":[{\"status\":\"success\",\"message\":\"Settings retrieved\",\"data\":{\"type\":\"all_raw_settings\",\"total_matches\":4,\"matches\":[{\"key\":\"domId\",\"value\":\"\"},{\"key\":\"visibility\",\"value\":false},{\"key\":\"code\",\"value\":\"<!-- /services - THE STACK\\n     10 service rows in 6 install layers (Diagnose / Capture / Instrument / Build / Distribute / Brand).\\n     Sticky left-rail layer labels (rail aria-hidden because each row carries its own layer label).\\n     Each row is a <button> toggle with aria-expanded; detail panel reveals via CSS grid-template-rows trick.\\n     HTML ONLY. No <style>, no <script>. CSS lives in pages/services/head.html. JS lives in pages/services/body.html. -->\\n<div class=\\\"pmc-stack\\\" role=\\\"list\\\" aria-label=\\\"The Stack: services grouped by install layer\\\">\\n\\n  <div class=\\\"pmc-stack-rail\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">\\n    <div data-layer=\\\"diagnose\\\">Diagnose</div>\\n    <div data-layer=\\\"capture\\\">Capture</div>\\n    <div data-layer=\\\"instrument\\\">Instrument</div>\\n    <div data-layer=\\\"build\\\">Build</div>\\n    <div data-layer=\\\"distribute\\\">Distribute</div>\\n    <div data-layer=\\\"brand\\\">Brand</div>\\n  </div>\\n\\n  <div class=\\\"pmc-stack-rows\\\">\\n\\n    <!-- 01 - Full-funnel marketing audit (DIAGNOSE) -->\\n    <article id=\\\"svc-audit\\\" class=\\\"pmc-stack-row\\\" data-layer=\\\"diagnose\\\" role=\\\"listitem\\\">\\n      <button class=\\\"pmc-stack-toggle\\\" type=\\\"button\\\" aria-controls=\\\"svc-audit-detail\\\">\\n        <span class=\\\"pmc-stack-num\\\">01 / DIAGNOSE</span>\\n        <span class=\\\"pmc-stack-name\\\">\\n          Full-funnel marketing audit\\n          <span class=\\\"pmc-stack-stance\\\">What your stack is actually doing, line by line.</span>\\n        </span>\\n        <span class=\\\"pmc-stack-glyph\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">+</span>\\n      </button>\\n      <div class=\\\"pmc-stack-detail\\\" id=\\\"svc-audit-detail\\\">\\n        <div>\\n          <p class=\\\"pmc-stack-install\\\">I read your full funnel end to end - software bill, analytics, channel mix, messaging, brand surfaces - and write a one-document diagnosis you can act on without me.</p>\\n          <ul class=\\\"pmc-stack-deliverables\\\">\\n            <li class=\\\"pmc-stack-deliverable\\\">Stack inventory + overlap map</li>\\n            <li class=\\\"pmc-stack-deliverable\\\">Channel-by-channel waste read</li>\\n            <li class=\\\"pmc-stack-deliverable\\\">90-day install plan with sequencing</li>\\n          </ul>\\n          <p class=\\\"pmc-stack-cost\\\">Without this you keep paying for tools that quietly cancel each other out.</p>\\n          <div class=\\\"pmc-stack-pairs\\\">\\n            <span class=\\\"pmc-stack-pairs-label\\\">Pairs with</span>\\n            <a class=\\\"pmc-stack-pair\\\" href=\\\"#svc-ga4\\\">GA4 + attribution</a>\\n            <a class=\\\"pmc-stack-pair\\\" href=\\\"#svc-messaging\\\">Messaging</a>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </article>\\n\\n    <!-- 02 - Social audit (DIAGNOSE) -->\\n    <article id=\\\"svc-social\\\" class=\\\"pmc-stack-row\\\" data-layer=\\\"diagnose\\\" role=\\\"listitem\\\">\\n      <button class=\\\"pmc-stack-toggle\\\" type=\\\"button\\\" aria-controls=\\\"svc-social-detail\\\">\\n        <span class=\\\"pmc-stack-num\\\">02 / DIAGNOSE</span>\\n        <span class=\\\"pmc-stack-name\\\">\\n          Social audit\\n          <span class=\\\"pmc-stack-stance\\\">Where attention is going, and why it is not converting.</span>\\n        </span>\\n        <span class=\\\"pmc-stack-glyph\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">+</span>\\n      </button>\\n      <div class=\\\"pmc-stack-detail\\\" id=\\\"svc-social-detail\\\">\\n        <div>\\n          <p class=\\\"pmc-stack-install\\\">I look at every channel you actually run - organic, paid, owned - and tell you what is working, what is wasted, and which surfaces are eating budget without earning it.</p>\\n          <ul class=\\\"pmc-stack-deliverables\\\">\\n            <li class=\\\"pmc-stack-deliverable\\\">Channel-by-channel diagnosis</li>\\n            <li class=\\\"pmc-stack-deliverable\\\">Content audit + tone read</li>\\n            <li class=\\\"pmc-stack-deliverable\\\">Re-allocation plan</li>\\n          </ul>\\n          <p class=\\\"pmc-stack-cost\\\">Without this you keep boosting posts that have nothing to convert into.</p>\\n          <div class=\\\"pmc-stack-pairs\\\">\\n            <span class=\\\"pmc-stack-pairs-label\\\">Pairs with</span>\\n            <a class=\\\"pmc-stack-pair\\\" href=\\\"#svc-paid\\\">Paid media</a>\\n            <a class=\\\"pmc-stack-pair\\\" href=\\\"#svc-messaging\\\">Messaging</a>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </article>\\n\\n    <!-- 03 - SEO (CAPTURE) -->\\n    <article id=\\\"svc-seo\\\" class=\\\"pmc-stack-row\\\" data-layer=\\\"capture\\\" role=\\\"listitem\\\">\\n      <button class=\\\"pmc-stack-toggle\\\" type=\\\"button\\\" aria-controls=\\\"svc-seo-detail\\\">\\n        <span class=\\\"pmc-stack-num\\\">03 / CAPTURE</span>\\n        <span class=\\\"pmc-stack-name\\\">\\n          SEO\\n          <span class=\\\"pmc-stack-stance\\\">Show up where intent already exists.</span>\\n        </span>\\n        <span class=\\\"pmc-stack-glyph\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">+</span>\\n      </button>\\n      <div class=\\\"pmc-stack-detail\\\" id=\\\"svc-seo-detail\\\">\\n        <div>\\n          <p class=\\\"pmc-stack-install\\\">Technical audit, on-page rewrite, content scaffolding, and the schema and llms.txt layer most sites still skip. Built around the keywords your customers actually use, not the ones an old agency wishlisted.</p>\\n          <ul class=\\\"pmc-stack-deliverables\\\">\\n            <li class=\\\"pmc-stack-deliverable\\\">Indexation + crawl repair</li>\\n            <li clas