            "text": "{\"label\":\"legacy-offer\",\"action\":\"get_settings\",\"result\":[{\"status\":\"success\",\"message\":\"Settings retrieved\",\"data\":{\"type\":\"all_raw_settings\",\"total_matches\":4,\"matches\":[{\"key\":\"domId\",\"value\":\"\"},{\"key\":\"visibility\",\"value\":false},{\"key\":\"code\",\"value\":\"<!-- /services - THE ENGAGEMENT - v2.0 POLISH\\n     Polished variation of the home leak pattern. Distinct visual metaphor:\\n     animated top edge flows LEFT-TO-RIGHT across each card (install progress,\\n     not leak drain), with a running gold spark riding the edge. Same level\\n     of polish as leak: time-window pills, status tag, scroll-in stagger,\\n     hover lift, bottom summary line. Icons (i-scan / i-cal / i-web / i-cast)\\n     animate continuously via pmcFloat. HTML ONLY. -->\\n<div class=\\\"pmc-engage\\\" aria-label=\\\"How an engagement runs\\\">\\n  <div class=\\\"pmc-engage-track\\\" role=\\\"list\\\">\\n\\n    <article class=\\\"pmc-engage-card\\\" role=\\\"listitem\\\">\\n      <span class=\\\"pmc-engage-edge\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"></span>\\n      <span class=\\\"pmc-engage-spark\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"></span>\\n      <svg class=\\\"pmc-ico i-scan\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 64 64\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">\\n        <rect class=\\\"s2\\\" x=\\\"14\\\" y=\\\"14\\\" width=\\\"28\\\" height=\\\"34\\\" rx=\\\"4\\\" opacity=\\\".3\\\"/>\\n        <line class=\\\"row\\\" x1=\\\"20\\\" y1=\\\"22\\\" x2=\\\"36\\\" y2=\\\"22\\\" stroke=\\\"#5FA354\\\" stroke-width=\\\"1.6\\\" opacity=\\\".45\\\"/>\\n        <line class=\\\"flag\\\" x1=\\\"20\\\" y1=\\\"29\\\" x2=\\\"34\\\" y2=\\\"29\\\" stroke-width=\\\"1.6\\\"/>\\n        <line class=\\\"row\\\" x1=\\\"20\\\" y1=\\\"36\\\" x2=\\\"30\\\" y2=\\\"36\\\" stroke=\\\"#5FA354\\\" stroke-width=\\\"1.6\\\" opacity=\\\".45\\\"/>\\n        <line class=\\\"row\\\" x1=\\\"20\\\" y1=\\\"43\\\" x2=\\\"33\\\" y2=\\\"43\\\" stroke=\\\"#5FA354\\\" stroke-width=\\\"1.6\\\" opacity=\\\".45\\\"/>\\n        <g class=\\\"lens\\\">\\n          <circle class=\\\"s\\\" cx=\\\"31\\\" cy=\\\"30\\\" r=\\\"13\\\" style=\\\"stroke-width:2\\\"/>\\n          <path class=\\\"hl\\\" d=\\\"M25 24.5 A8 8 0 0 1 33.5 23.2\\\"/>\\n          <line class=\\\"s\\\" x1=\\\"40.5\\\" y1=\\\"39.5\\\" x2=\\\"49\\\" y2=\\\"48\\\" style=\\\"stroke-width:2.6\\\"/>\\n          <g class=\\\"beam transient\\\"><line class=\\\"sg bloomg\\\" x1=\\\"22\\\" y1=\\\"30\\\" x2=\\\"40\\\" y2=\\\"30\\\" style=\\\"stroke-width:1.4\\\"/></g>\\n          <circle class=\\\"ping transient sg\\\" cx=\\\"31\\\" cy=\\\"30\\\" r=\\\"3\\\" stroke-width=\\\"1.4\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\"/>\\n        </g>\\n      </svg>\\n      <span class=\\\"pmc-engage-step\\\">Step 01 / Audit</span>\\n      <h3 class=\\\"pmc-engage-title\\\">Audit</h3>\\n      <div class=\\\"pmc-engage-pills\\\">\\n        <span class=\\\"pmc-engage-pill\\\">Week 1-2</span>\\n        <span class=\\\"pmc-engage-pill\\\">Read</span>\\n        <span class=\\\"pmc-engage-pill\\\">Delivered</span>\\n      </div>\\n      <p class=\\\"pmc-engage-body\\\">Two weeks. I look at every channel, every tool, every dashboard. You get a written read of what is leaking and where the budget is hiding.</p>\\n      <span class=\\\"pmc-engage-status\\\">Reading the funnel</span>\\n    </article>\\n\\n    <article class=\\\"pmc-engage-card\\\" role=\\\"listitem\\\">\\n      <span class=\\\"pmc-engage-edge\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"></span>\\n      <span class=\\\"pmc-engage-spark\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"></span>\\n      <svg class=\\\"pmc-ico i-cal\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 64 64\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">\\n        <rect class=\\\"s\\\" x=\\\"14\\\" y=\\\"18\\\" width=\\\"36\\\" height=\\\"31\\\" rx=\\\"4.5\\\"/>\\n        <path class=\\\"hl\\\" d=\\\"M17 18.6 H47\\\"/>\\n        <line class=\\\"s2\\\" x1=\\\"14\\\" y1=\\\"26\\\" x2=\\\"50\\\" y2=\\\"26\\\"/>\\n        <line class=\\\"sg\\\" x1=\\\"23\\\" y1=\\\"13\\\" x2=\\\"23\\\" y2=\\\"20\\\" style=\\\"stroke-width:2\\\"/>\\n        <line class=\\\"sg\\\" x1=\\\"41\\\" y1=\\\"13\\\" x2=\\\"41\\\" y2=\\\"20\\\" style=\\\"stroke-width:2\\\"/>\\n        <rect class=\\\"chip c1\\\" x=\\\"19\\\" y=\\\"30\\\" width=\\\"6\\\" height=\\\"4.5\\\" rx=\\\"1.4\\\" fill=\\\"#5FA354\\\"/>\\n        <rect class=\\\"chip c2\\\" x=\\\"29\\\" y=\\\"30\\\" width=\\\"6\\\" height=\\\"4.5\\\" rx=\\\"1.4\\\" fill=\\\"#5FA354\\\"/>\\n        <rect class=\\\"chip c3\\\" x=\\\"19\\\" y=\\\"38\\\" width=\\\"6\\\" height=\\\"4.5\\\" rx=\\\"1.4\\\" fill=\\\"#5FA354\\\"/>\\n        <rect class=\\\"chip c4\\\" x=\\\"29\\\" y=\\\"38\\\" width=\\\"6\\\" height=\\\"4.5\\\" rx=\\\"1.4\\\" fill=\\\"url(#gGold)\\\"/>\\n        <circle class=\\\"focus transient sg\\\" cx=\\\"32\\\" cy=\\\"40.2\\\" r=\\\"6.4\\\" stroke-width=\\\"1.4\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\"/>\\n        <polyline class=\\\"check sg bloomg\\\" points=\\\"38,40 40.5,42.5 45,37\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" stroke-dasharray=\\\"11\\\"/>\\n      </svg>\\n      <span class=\\\"pmc-engage-step\\\">Step 02 / Diagnose</span>\\n      <h3 class=\\\"pmc-engage-title\\\">Diagnose</h3>\\n      <div class=\\\"pmc-engage-pills\\\">\\n        <span class=\\\"pmc-engage-pill\\\">Day 14</span>\\n        <span class=\\\"pmc-engage-pill\\\">Sync</span>\\n        <span class=\\\"pmc-engage-pill\\\">Plan</span>\\n      </div>\\n      <p class=\\\"pmc-engage-body\\\">We sit on the audit together. I walk you through the read, the install plan, and the trade-offs. You decide what gets installed first.</p>\\n      <span class=\\\"pmc-engage-status\\\">Aligning the plan</span>\\n    </article>\\n\\n    <article class=\\\"pmc-engage-card\\\" role=\\\"listitem\\\">\\n      <span class=\\\"pmc-engage-edge\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"></span>\\n      <span class=\\\"pmc-engage-spark\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"></span>\\n      <svg class=\\\"pmc-ico i-web\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 64 64\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">\\n        <rect class=\\\"s2\\\" x=\\\"21\\\" y=\\\"11\\\" width=\\\"31\\\" height=\\\"25\\\" rx=\\\"4\\\" opacity=\\\".3\\\"/>\\n        <rect class=\\\"s\\\" x=\\\"13\\\" y=\\\"17\\\" width=\\\"34\\\" height=\\\"29\\\" rx=\\\"4.5\\\"/>\\n        <path class=\\\"hl\\\" d=\\\"M16 17.6 H44\\\"/>\\n        <line class=\\\"s2\\\" x1=\\\"13\\\" y1=\\\"25\\\" x2=\\\"47\\\" y2=\\\"25\\\"/>\\n        <circle class=\\\"fl\\\" cx=\\\"18\\\" cy=\\\"21\\\" r=\\\"1.3\\\"/>\\n        <circle class=\\\"fl\\\" cx=\\\"22.4\\\" cy=\\\"21\\\" r=\\\"1.3\\\"/>\\n        <rect class=\\\"fg\\\" x=\\\"33\\\" y=\\\"19.4\\\" width=\\\"11\\\" height=\\\"3.2\\\" rx=\\\"1.6\\\" opacity=\\\"0.45\\\"/>\\n        <rect class=\\\"deploy fg bloomg\\\" x=\\\"13.6\\\" y=\\\"16.2\\\" width=\\\"32.8\\\" height=\\\"1.8\\\" rx=\\\"1\\\"/>\\n        <rect class=\\\"b1 fl\\\" x=\\\"18\\\" y=\\\"29\\\" width=\\\"16\\\" height=\\\"2.6\\\" rx=\\\"1.3\\\"/>\\n        <rect class=\\\"b2 fl\\\" x=\\\"18\\\" y=\\\"34\\\" width=\\\"11\\\" height=\\\"2.2\\\" rx=\\\"1.1\\\" opacity=\\\"0.82\\\"/>\\n        <rect class=\\\"b3 fl\\\" x=\\\"18\\\" y=\\\"38.4\\\" width=\\\"13\\\" height=\\\"2.2\\\" rx=\\\"1.1\\\" opacity=\\\"0.82\\\"/>\\n        <rect class=\\\"b4 sg\\\" x=\\\"36\\\" y=\\\"29\\\" width=\\\"8\\\" height=\\\"11.6\\\" rx=\\\"2\\\"/>\\n      </svg>\\n      <span class=\\\"pmc-engage-step\\\">Step 03 / Install</span>\\n      <h3 class=\\\"pmc-engage-title\\\">Install</h3>\\n      <div class=\\\"pmc-engage-pills\\\">\\n        <span class=\\\"pmc-engage-pill\\\">Week 3-12</span>\\n        <span class=\\\"pmc-engage-pill\\\">Build</span>\\n        <span class=\\\"pmc-engage-pill\\\">Wire</span>\\n      </div>\\n      <p class=\\\"pmc-engage-body\\\">90 days. Site, instrumentation, messaging, the first paid layer, the first content layer. You watch it ship, live and tracked from day one.</p>\\n      <span class=\\\"pmc-engage-status\\\">Shipping the engine</span>\\n    </article>\\n\\n    <article class=\\\"pmc-engage-card\\\" role=\\\"listitem\\\">\\n      <span class=\\\"pmc-engage-edge\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"></span>\\n      <span class=\\\"pmc-engage-spark\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"></span>\\n      <svg class=\\\"pmc-ico i-cast\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 64 64\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">\\n        <line class=\\\"s2\\\" x1=\\\"32\\\" y1=\\\"32\\\" x2=\\\"18\\\" y2=\\\"18\\\"/>\\n        <line class=\\\"s2\\\" x1=\\\"32\\\" y1=\\\"32\\\" x2=\\\"46\\\" y2=\\\"18\\\"/>\\n        <line class=\\\"s2\\\" x1=\\\"32\\\" y1=\\\"32\\\" x2=\\\"18\\\" y2=\\\"46\\\"/>\\n        <line class=\\\"s2\\\" x1=\\\"32\\\" y1=\\\"32\\\" x2=\\\"46\\\" y2=\\\"46\\\"/>\\n        <circle class=\\\"wave v1 transient\\\" cx=\\\"32\\\" cy=\\\"32\\\" r=\\\"11\\\" stroke=\\\"url(#gLeaf)\\\" stroke-width=\\\"1.6\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\"/>\\n        <circle class=\\\"wave v2 transient\\\" cx=\\\"32\\\" cy=\\\"32\\\" r=\\\"16\\\" stroke=\\\"url(#gLeaf)\\\" stroke-width=\\\"1.6\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\"/>\\n        <circle class=\\\"wave v3 transient\\\" cx=\\\"32\\\" cy=\\\"32\\\" r=\\\"21\\\" stroke=\\\"url(#gGold)\\\" stroke-width=\\\"1.6\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\"/>\\n        <circle class=\\\"ep e1\\\" cx=\\\"18\\\" cy=\\\"18\\\" r=\\\"3.4\\\" fill=\\\"#071312\\\" stroke=\\\"url(#gLeaf)\\\" stroke-width=\\\"1.6\\\"/>\\n        <circle class=\\\"ep e2\\\" cx=\\\"46\\\" cy=\\\"18\\\" r=\\\"3.4\\\" fill=\\\"#071312\\\" stroke=\\\"url(#gLeaf)\\\" stroke-width=\\\"1.6\\\"/>\\n        <circle class=\\\"ep e3\\\" cx=\\\"18\\\" cy=\\\"46\\\" r=\\\"3.4\\\" fill=\\\"#071312\\\" stroke=\\\"url(#gLeaf)\\\" stroke-width=\\\"1.6\\\"/>\\n        <circle class=\\\"ep e4\\\" cx=\\\"46\\\" cy=\\\"46\\\" r=\\\"3.4\\\" fill=\\\"#071312\\\" stroke=\\\"url(#gLeaf)\\\" stroke-width=\\\"1.6\\\"/>\\n        <circle class=\\\"core fg bloomg\\\" cx=\\\"32\\\" cy=\\\"32\\\" r=\\\"4.3\\\"/>\\n      </svg>\\n      <span class=\\\"pmc-engage-step\\\">Step 04 / Run</span>\\n      <h3 class=\\\"pmc-engage-title\\\">Run</h3>\\n      <div class=\\\"pmc-engage-pills\\\">\\n        <span class=\\\"pmc-engage-pill\\\">Day 90+</span>\\n        <span class=\\\"pmc-engage-pill\\\">Operate</span>\\n        <span class=\\\"pmc-engage-pill\\\">Live</span>\\n      </div>\\n      <p class=\\\"pmc-engage-body\\\">Optional retainer. I keep operating the engine for you, or I hand it off to your team with a runbook. Either way, the system keeps running and your results keep compounding.</p>\\n      <span class=\\\"pmc-engage-status\\\">Yours to operate</span>\\n    </article>\\n\\n  </div>\\n  <div class=\\\"pmc-engage-foot\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">\\n    <span>Each phase compounds into the next - by Day 90 the engine is live and running</span>\\n    <span class=\\\"pmc-engage-foot-line\\\"></span>\\n  </div>\\n</div>\"},{\"key\":\"attributes\",\"value\":[{\"name\":\"hidden\",\"value\":\"hidden\"},{\"name\":\"aria-hidden\",\"value\":\"true\"},{\"name\":\"data-pmc-preserved-source\",\"value\":\"services-legacy-offer-embed\"}]}]}}]}"
